OL,3,GNEWSA'I was terrified to talk about my
OL,4,Adaughter until baby loss garden'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor a long time, Emily Kinber found it
OL,7,Fdifficult to talk about her daughter
OL,8,FHallie, who died four hours after she
OL,9,Fwas born.
OL,11,FNow, she says a memorial garden created
OL,12,Fby bereaved parents has given her the
OL,13,Fconfidence to share her story.
OL,15,F"I was absolutely terrified at first to
OL,16,Fbe able to speak about Hallie, but
OL,17,Fsince joining the Pickering Foundation
OL,18,Fwe've become one big community and it's
OL,19,Fso positive," she said.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
